        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-ink leading-tight mb-5">What is EMDR Therapy? How Does It Work for Trauma?</h1>
        <p class="text-ink-muted text-lg leading-relaxed">EMDR is a scientifically well-evidenced therapy method that changes how traumatic memories are processed in the brain.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-12 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8">
