                <div><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Desensitisation</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">The memory is reprocessed with eye movements or tactile stimulation.</p></div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-4 bg-warm rounded-xl p-4 border border-warm-tertiary">
                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary text-white text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">5–8</span>
                <div><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Installation, body scan, closure, re-evaluation</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Positive belief is reinforced, body responses are checked, the process is completed.</p></div>
              </div>
            </div>
