          <div>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink mb-4">EMDR therapy in North Cyprus</h2>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Looking for EMDR therapy in Cyprus? Famagusta Psychology Centre offers individual EMDR sessions with trained psychologists. Sessions are available in person at our Famagusta centre or online — making EMDR therapy accessible across North Cyprus.</p>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Working with a certified EMDR practitioner is essential for a safe and effective process. Our team follows international EMDR standards and works with adults experiencing trauma, anxiety, phobias and more.</p>
